WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.330
Ten questions.

2
00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:02.930
Four options on each.

3
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.990
Five correct to pass.

4
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.110
You haven't revised a thing.

5
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.840
So you guess every answer at random.

6
00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:13.100
Each guess has a one in
four chance of being right.

7
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.500
So what's the chance of
scraping five or more?

8
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.640
About half?

9
00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:19.110
About a quarter?

10
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:23.330
In this mission, you'll treat the number
you get right as a random variable,

11
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.880
with a probability for every value.

12
00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:29.130
You'll check the conditions
for a binomial distribution:

13
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.510
a fixed number of trials, two
outcomes, independent trials,

14
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.200
and a constant probability of success.

15
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.730
And you'll find five or more as one
minus the probability of four or fewer.

16
00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:46.290
Your mission: find the chance that
pure guessing gets you five or more.
